WEBVTT

00:06:58.457 --> 00:07:00.858
In the case of the shower:

00:07:00.882 --> 00:07:05.390
does it have hot and cold water,
two taps that work,

00:07:05.414 --> 00:07:10.163
a shower rose to get water
onto your head or onto your body,

00:07:10.187 --> 00:07:12.021
and a drain that takes the water away?

00:07:12.045 --> 00:07:16.093
Not well-designed,
not beautiful, not elegant --

00:07:16.117 --> 00:07:17.284
just that they function.

00:07:17.308 --> 00:07:19.531
And the same tests
for the electrical system

00:07:19.555 --> 00:07:20.886
and the toilets.

00:07:21.811 --> 00:07:24.743
Housing for Health projects
aren't about measuring failure --

00:07:24.767 --> 00:07:27.065
they're actually about improving houses.

00:07:27.475 --> 00:07:31.369
We start on day one of every project.